			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n* Added Petrified Oak Log, Stripped Petrified Oak Log, Petrified Oak Planks, Petrified Oak Stairs, and reintroduced Petrified Oak Slab to the Creative Mode inventory.\n* Added a new feature to the Wooden Pickaxe: when the pickaxe level is >0, holding Shift + Right-click can break a 3x3 area of blocks with a thickness of <level> in front of the player. Cooldown: 1 second.\n* Adapted the \"Efficiency\" enchantment for the Wooden Pickaxe, reducing the skill cooldown by <enchantment level> ticks when the skill is activated.\n* Added a new enchantment \"Excavation Range\", which increases the skill's range by 1 \\* <enchantment level> when activated."
		},
