			"notes": "# Changelog\n* All types of wood tools are included.\n* Changed the upgrade method for the Wood Pickaxe. Now the blocks that need to be dug for each pickaxe are different, with a total of three levels, and the number has been greatly reduced.\n* Added the Ultimate Wooden Pickaxe.\n* Added a special method to maxed out the Wooden Pickaxe to automatically craft the Ultimate Wooden Pickaxe when the player has all types of maxed Wooden Pickaxes in their backpack and a Nether Heart. The Ultimate Pickaxe inherits all the effects of the previous maxed Wooden Pickaxe.\n* Reduced the durability of wooden pickaxes.\n* Reduced the mining speed of stone pickaxes."
		},
